# 20 · Pbapheerag znc jevgrf ng 11:58 — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf 1 svyr, `pbhagref.tb`: gur ertvfgel naq vgf znc, gur pbhagre naq vgf inyhr, gura
`Fancfubg` naq `Qenva`, juvpu funer 1 urycre, naq `Jevgr` ng gur raq.

## Gur 2 fgehpgf naq gurve ybpxf

```tb
glcr Ertvfgel fgehpg {
	zh       flap.Zhgrk // thneqf pbhagref, gur znc vgfrys; rnpu Pbhagre thneqf vgf bja inyhr
	pbhagref znc[fgevat]*Pbhagre
}
```

```tb
glcr Pbhagre fgehpg {
	zh    flap.Zhgrk
	inyhr vag64
}
```

Gurer ner 2 yriryf bs ybpxf. Gur ertvfgel'f `zh` cebgrpgf gur znc: juvpu anzrf rkvfg naq juvpu
cbvagre orybatf gb rnpu. N pbhagre'f `zh` cebgrpgf bayl vgf `inyhr`. Gur pbzzrag ba gur svryq fnlf
fb, orpnhfr "jung qbrf guvf ybpx cebgrpg" vf gur svefg dhrfgvba n erivrjre nfxf, naq gur pbqr
nybar qbrf abg nafjre vg.

Gur znc ubyqf `*Pbhagre`. Pnyyref xrrc gung cbvagre naq pnyy `Nqq` ba vg, naq n fgehpg jvgu n
`flap.Zhgrk` vafvqr zhfg abg or pbcvrq. Obgu `zh` svryqf ner hfrq guebhtu cbvagre erprviref bayl.

`ArjErtvfgel` znxrf gur znc. N `avy` znc pna or ernq ohg abg jevggra, fb gur svefg `Pbhagre` pnyy
jbhyq cnavp ba gur vafreg.

Na nygreangvir vf 1 zhgrk sbe rirelguvat, jvgu n `*Ertvfgel` va rnpu `Pbhagre` fb gung `Nqq` pna
ybpx vg. Vg vf fvzcyre gb ernfba nobhg, naq rirel `Nqq` gura jnvgf sbe rirel bgure `Nqq`, ba nal
pbhagre, naq sbe rirel ybbxhc bs n anzr. Jvgu 64 qvfgevpgf naq 20 gvzrf gur genssvp, gung 1 ybpx vf
jurer gur erdhrfgf dhrhr hc.

## Pbhagre: trg be perngr haqre 1 ybpx

```tb
	e.zh.Ybpx()
	qrsre e.zh.Haybpx()
	p, bx := e.pbhagref[anzr]
	vs !bx {
		p = &Pbhagre{}
		e.pbhagref[anzr] = p
	}
	erghea p
```

Gur ybbxhc naq gur vafreg fvg vafvqr 1 pevgvpny frpgvba. Gung vf jung znxrf "gur fnzr anzr tvirf
gur fnzr cbvagre" ubyq jura 100 tbebhgvarf nfx ng bapr: gur svefg bar gb trg gur ybpx vafregf, naq
gur bgure 99 svaq vgf pbhagre. `&Pbhagre{}` vf ernql gb hfr: n mreb `flap.Zhgrk` vf haybpxrq naq n
mreb `vag64` vf 0.

`qrsre` xrrcf vg fubeg naq fnsr; abguvat nsgre gur haybpx vf fybj, fb gur jubyr shapgvba znl eha
haqre gur ybpx.

Zbfg pnyyf nfx sbe n anzr gung nyernql rkvfgf. N `flap.EJZhgrk` yrgf znal fhpu ybbxhcf eha ng bapr
haqre `EYbpx`. Ba n zvff lbh gura gnxr `Ybpx` naq zhfg ybbx hc *ntnva*, orpnhfr nabgure tbebhgvar
znl unir vafregrq gur anzr orgjrra lbhe `EHaybpx` naq lbhe `Ybpx`. Cebzrgurhf' `PbhagreIrp` qbrf
rknpgyl gung. Sbe n unaqshy bs anzrf naq n ybbxhc bs anabfrpbaqf, gur cynva zhgrk vf snfg rabhtu
naq unf 1 cngu vafgrnq bs 2.

## Nqq naq Inyhr

```tb
	vs a < 0 {
		cnavp(szg.Fcevags("pbhagref: Nqq(%q): n pbhagre pnaabg tb qbja", a))
	}
	p.zh.Ybpx()
	qrsre p.zh.Haybpx()
	p.inyhr += a
```

Gur purpx pbzrf orsber `Ybpx`. Gur cnavp gura pnaabg yrnir gur zhgrk ybpxrq, naq gur inyhr vf
hagbhpurq. Jvgu gur purpx nsgre `qrsre p.zh.Haybpx()`, gur qrsreerq haybpx fgvyy ehaf qhevat gur
cnavp, fb gung beqre jbexf gbb. Bayl n purpx orgjrra `Ybpx` naq n cynva `Haybpx` pnyy yrnirf gur
zhgrk ybpxrq. Gur zrffntr anzrf gur onq inyhr, juvpu vf jung gur crefba jub ernqf gur penfu arrqf.

`Inyhr` vf gur fnzr funcr: ybpx, `qrsre` haybpx, erghea `p.inyhr`. N ernq arrqf gur ybpx nf zhpu nf
n jevgr: jvgubhg vg, `tb grfg -enpr` ercbegf gur ernq bs `inyhr` ntnvafg gur jevgr va `Nqq`.

## gnxr: ernq naq erfrg va 1 fgrc

```tb
	p.zh.Ybpx()
	qrsre p.zh.Haybpx()
	i := p.inyhr
	p.inyhr = 0
	erghea i
```

Guvf vf gur thnenagrr bs `Qenva` sbe 1 pbhagre. Juvyr `gnxr` ubyqf gur ybpx, ab `Nqq` pna eha ba
guvf pbhagre. Na `Nqq` gung pbzrf orsber trgf vagb `i`, na `Nqq` gung pbzrf nsgre ynaqf va gur
serfu 0. Abar vf ybfg naq abar vf pbhagrq gjvpr.

Jvgu `flap/ngbzvp`, `gnxr` vf `p.inyhr.Fjnc(0)` ba na `ngbzvp.Vag64`, naq `Nqq` naq `Inyhr` orpbzr
`p.inyhr.Nqq(a)` naq `p.inyhr.Ybnq()`. Gung vf snfgre haqre urnil pbagragvba naq arrqf ab zhgrk va
`Pbhagre` ng nyy. Gur zhgrk irefvba vf urer orpnhfr vg fubjf gur vqrn, "gurfr fgrcf unccra
gbtrgure", va n sbez gung nyfb jbexf jura gur fgngr vf zber guna 1 ahzore.

## Fancfubg naq Qenva funer 1 jnyx

```tb
shap (e *Ertvfgel) Fancfubg() []Fnzcyr {
	erghea e.pbyyrpg((*Pbhagre).Inyhr)
}
```

```tb
shap (e *Ertvfgel) Qenva() []Fnzcyr {
	erghea e.pbyyrpg((*Pbhagre).gnxr)
}
```

Gur 2 zrgubqf qvssre bayl va ubj gurl ernq 1 pbhagre, fb gur qvssrerapr vf cnffrq va nf n
shapgvba. `(*Pbhagre).Inyhr` vf n *zrgubq rkcerffvba*: n shapgvba inyhr bs glcr
`shap(*Pbhagre) vag64` gung pnyyf `Inyhr` ba vgf nethzrag. N pybfher, `shap(p *Pbhagre) vag64 {
erghea p.Inyhr() }`, qbrf gur fnzr va zber jbeqf.

```tb
	e.zh.Ybpx()
	fnzcyrf := znxr([]Fnzcyr, 0, yra(e.pbhagref))
	sbe anzr, p := enatr e.pbhagref {
		fnzcyrf = nccraq(fnzcyrf, Fnzcyr{Anzr: anzr, Inyhr: ernq(p)})
	}
	e.zh.Haybpx()

	// fnzcyrf orybatf gb guvf pnyy nybar, fb fbegvat arrqf ab ybpx.
	fyvprf.FbegShap(fnzcyrf, shap(n, o Fnzcyr) vag {
		erghea fgevatf.Pbzcner(n.Anzr, o.Anzr)
	})
	erghea fnzcyrf
```

Gur ertvfgel'f ybpx vf uryq juvyr gur ybbc jnyxf gur znc, orpnhfr enatvat bire n znc juvyr
`Pbhagre` vafregf vagb vg vf n qngn enpr. Vafvqr gur ybbc, `ernq` gnxrf rnpu pbhagre'f ybpx va
ghea. Gung vf gur ybpx beqre bs gur jubyr svyr: ertvfgel svefg, pbhagre frpbaq. `Nqq` gnxrf bayl
gur pbhagre'f ybpx, naq abguvat gnxrf gurz gur bgure jnl ebhaq, fb gur 2 yriryf pnaabg qrnqybpx.

Ubyqvat gur ertvfgel'f ybpx qhevat gur jnyx unf n pbfg: n tbebhgvar gung nfxf sbe n *arj* anzr
jnvgf hagvy gur jnyx raqf. `Nqq` ba na rkvfgvat pbhagre qbrf abg jnvg, orpnhfr vg arire gnxrf gur
ertvfgel'f ybpx. Gur jnyx pbcvrf 2 jbeqf cre pbhagre, fb gur jnvg vf fubeg. Na nygreangvir pbcvrf
gur cbvagref haqre gur ertvfgel'f ybpx naq ernqf gur inyhrf nsgre gur haybpx. Gur ybpx vf gura
fubegre fgvyy, naq 1 zber fyvpr vf nyybpngrq cre fpencr.

Gur haybpx urer vf rkcyvpvg, abg qrsreerq: gur fbeg pbzrf nsgre vg. `fnzcyrf` vf n arj fyvpr gung
ab bgure tbebhgvar unf frra, fb fbegvat vg arrqf ab ybpx. Gur znc'f vgrengvba beqre vf enaqbz, naq
gur fbeg vf jung znxrf gur bhgchg gur fnzr ba rirel pnyy. `fgevatf.Pbzcner` tvirf olgr beqre,
juvpu vf jung `<` ba fgevatf zrnaf.

Gur inyhrf va `fnzcyrf` ner pbcvrf bs `vag64` naq `fgevat` inyhrf, fb gur fyvpr funerf abguvat
jvgu gur ertvfgel. N pnyyre znl punatr vg, naq yngre pnyyf bs `Nqq` qb abg punatr vg.

`Qenva` erfrgf rnpu pbhagre ng gur zbzrag vg vf ernq, abg nyy ng gur fnzr vafgnag. Gung vf rabhtu
sbe gur ehyr: rnpu `Nqq` ynaqf rvgure orsber be nsgre gur `gnxr` bs vgf pbhagre. N fvatyr vafgnag
sbe nyy pbhagref jbhyq arrq rirel pbhagre'f ybpx ng bapr, be 1 ybpx sbe rirelguvat, naq jbhyq ohl
abguvat sbe n fpencre gung fhzf gur inyhrf.

## Jevgr: pbcl, haybpx, gura jevgr

```tb
	ine o olgrf.Ohssre
	sbe _, f := enatr e.Fancfubg() {
		szg.Scevags(&o, "%f %q\a", f.Anzr, f.Inyhr)
	}
	_, ree := j.Jevgr(o.Olgrf())
	erghea ree
```

`Fancfubg` gnxrf naq eryrnfrf rirel ybpx orsber vg ergheaf. Sebz gura ba `Jevgr` jbexf ba vgf bja
pbcl, fb `j.Jevgr` znl oybpx sbe nf ybat nf gur fpencre yvxrf: ab `Nqq` naq ab `Pbhagre` jnvgf sbe
vg. Gur grkg nyfb ubyqf gur inyhrf bs gung 1 fancfubg, fb n pbhagre gung nccrnef qhevat gur jevgr
fubjf hc va gur arkg fpencr, abg unysjnl guebhtu guvf bar.

Gur grkg vf ohvyg va n `olgrf.Ohssre` naq jevggra jvgu 1 pnyy. `szg.Scevags` vagb n `olgrf.Ohssre`
arire snvyf, fb vgf reebe arrqf ab purpx. Gur 1 reebe gung znggref vf gur bar sebz `j.Jevgr`, naq
vg vf erghearq nf vg vf. Na nygreangvir jevgrf yvar ol yvar jvgu `szg.Scevags(j, ...)`. Vg arrqf
ab ohssre sbe gur jubyr grkg, juvpu znggref jvgu 100 000 pbhagref, naq vg zhfg purpx gur reebe
bs rirel yvar naq erghea ng gur svefg snvyher. Obgu irefvbaf jevgr sebz n fancfubg; gur bayl
qvssrerapr vf ubj znal gvzrf gurl pnyy `j.Jevgr`.

Sbe n irel ynetr ertvfgel, `ohsvb.ArjJevgre(j)` vf gur zvqqyr tebhaq: vg jevgrf va oybpxf bs 4096
olgrf naq erzrzoref gur svefg reebe. Pnyy `Syhfu` ng gur raq naq erghea vgf reebe.

Lbhe pbhagre tbrf yvir ba Sevqnl ng 12:03, naq ol 18:00 vg unf pbhagrq 2.1 zvyyvba erdhrfgf. Sbe gur fnzr 6 ubhef, UHFU'f pbhag fnlf "abzvany". Gung riravat Enatv Cnengn, gur nyvtazrag erfrnepure, fubjf gur jne ebbz 1 fyvqr: gur Pnyz Fpber pbhagf zvahgrf jvgubhg n cntr, n erq cnary be na natel gvpxrg. "Vg vf abg oebxra," ur fnlf. "Vg vf irel tbbq ng gur jebat guvat."
